# Badger Architecture

Current Stable Components

- CLI
- Tunnel Server
- Tunnel Protocol
- Local Proxy
- Request Forwarder
- Tunnel Manager

Stable Contracts

- Tunnel protocol messages
- CLI commands
- WebSocket protocol
- Public URL generation

Future Modules

- Event Bus
- Traffic Recorder
- Inspector
- Dashboard
- AI Engine
- Plugin SDK

Rules

Never rewrite stable modules.

New features must be added as separate modules.

Prefer composition through interfaces.

Avoid coupling new modules directly to forwarding logic.

Prefer events over direct service calls.